# CoalTrack AI - Major UI/UX & Role-Based Access Overhaul

You are a senior full-stack engineer and UI/UX designer.

Your task is to completely redesign the CoalTrack AI web application into a production-quality Government Coal Mine Governance Portal suitable for Smart India Hackathon (SIH).

DO NOT create placeholder pages.

DO NOT simplify the application.

Everything should look like a real government portal used daily by thousands of employees.

Maintain the existing tech stack and project structure.

--------------------------------------------------------

PROJECT GOAL

CoalTrack AI is an AI-powered platform for managing coal mine operations, worker safety, inspections, attendance, statutory compliance, and DGMS governance.

The application must have completely different experiences for each user role.

Every role should immediately understand:

• What they are responsible for
• What actions they can perform
• What information they are allowed to access

No dashboard should feel identical.

